		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Dragon that succumbed to blight. Alive but perpetually rotting. Often allies with death cults. Stinks of decay.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 48, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 rend +8 (2d8) or 1 rot breath, <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +0, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +2, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 10</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Great Evil</strong>. Only damaged by silver or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Rot</strong>. CON 15+ or 1d4 CON damage (can't heal while ill). Repeat check every turn; ends on success. Die at 0 CON.</p><p></p><p><strong>Rot Breath</strong>. Fills a double near-sized cube with greasy, diseased miasma extending from dragon. All mortals within, exposed to rot.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
